SUMMARY:Full Day Access Bars Swap & Potluck
DESCRIPTION:Access Consciousness® Asheville\nHappy Holidays to you! We're
  going to be gathering for a full day Bars swap with a potluck at 1:30pm. 
 Come for the swap in the morning\, the one in the afternoon or for the who
 le day!\n\nBars! Energetic Facelift!! & Body Processes!!!\n\nHave you ever
  taken a Access Bars®\, Access Energetic Facelift™ or Body Process clas
 s?\nYes. Then this meet up is for you! Even if you need to borrow a head c
 hart or ask questions because you don't remember where the points are\, yo
 u are welcome.\n\nWe'll be gathering at my home in Marshall where we will 
 be having an afternoon Bars swap. RSVP here since Meetup doesn't reliably 
 send me updates about event attendees: https://www.accessconsciousness.com
 /en/class-catalog/access-events/at-a-venue/Access-Bars-Gifting--Receiving_
 639310617943985730/\n\nPlease either bring a dish as a contribution to the
  space or funds ($10) to support the purchase of food for everyone.\n\nIf 
 you have not taken an Access Bars class there will be one the day before a
 t the same location. Please reach out directly to hello (at) conscious bei
 ng . institute if you have any questions.
